    "class": "gps-632338944540869269 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632338944423363221&sectionId=632338944540869269)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYn5jzugVy_text","label":"ggYn5jzugVy_text","default":"Celebrate the Bridesmaids Who Stood Beside You"},{"type":"html","id":"ggthVMGPh25_text","label":"ggthVMGPh25_text","default":"<p>Your bridesmaids were there through the excitement, planning, and unforgettable moments leading up to your wedding. They celebrated your engagement, helped you prepare for the big day, and stood beside you as you began a new chapter.</p><p>A personalized thank-you gift lets them know their friendship and support meant more than words can express.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Choose a favorite photo from your bridal shower, bachelorette party, getting-ready moments, or wedding day, and turn it into a custom Memobrick they'll treasure as a reminder of the memories you shared together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGI2F74Szi_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggGI2F74Szi_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/67d740a2-7b72-4e61-8f39-35b0f7d2955a.png"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_DtBUTE3__text","label":"gg_DtBUTE3__text","default":"More Than a Gift—A Memory You Can Build"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxilQbrvJG_text","label":"ggxilQbrvJG_text","default":"<p>The most meaningful gifts aren't always the most expensive—they're the ones filled with personal memories. Memobrick transforms a favorite photo into a custom brick mosaic that recipients can build and proudly display in their homes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Unlike traditional thank-you gifts, a Memobrick offers something extra: a creative building experience that makes the gift itself even more memorable. As each brick comes together, so does the story behind the photo, creating a keepsake that's both interactive and deeply personal.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcc16Czy3A_text","label":"ggcc16Czy3A_text","default":"<p>The best thank-you gifts begin with the right photo. Consider selecting an image that captures a meaningful connection rather than simply a perfect pose.</p><p>Some wonderful photo ideas include:</p><ul><li>A heartfelt moment with your parents before the ceremony.</li><li>Walking down the aisle together.</li><li>A family portrait from your wedding day.</li><li>A joyful group photo with your bridesmaids.</li><li>Candid laughter while getting ready.</li><li>A memorable moment from your engagement celebration or bridal shower.</li><li>A favorite wedding portrait that captures the happiness of the day.</li></ul><p>Choose a clear, high-quality image with good lighting to create the best-looking Memobrick.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrEzI4iest_text","label":"ggrEzI4iest_text","default":"<p>Long after the flowers have faded and the decorations have been packed away, the memories of your wedding day remain. A personalized Memobrick becomes a lasting reminder of those unforgettable moments, celebrating the love, friendship, and support that made your special day complete.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Whether displayed in a living room, office, or family space, it serves as a daily reminder of the people and memories that made your wedding truly unforgettable.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtQrsBIJLG_text","label":"ggtQrsBIJLG_text","default":"<p>Your wedding is more than a celebration—it's a collection of moments shared with the people who helped shape your journey. A personalized Memobrick is a heartfelt way to thank your parents, bridesmaids, and loved ones by turning those treasured memories into keepsakes they'll cherish for years to come.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because the greatest thank-you gifts aren't simply given—they're filled with the love, memories, and appreciation that make them unforgettable.</p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
    "locales": {}
  }
